9. App (real hardware)

The firmware creates Wi‑Fi SmartPole-AP / password 12345678. Open http://192.168.4.1 for live solar W, wind W, load W, battery %, lamp and purifier state.

On a real highway you would later add a router or SIM900 SMS; the prototype AP is enough to prove the idea.
